# TradingView Advanced Charts — vendored at build time, NEVER committed.
#
# THIS REPO IS PUBLIC (verified 2026-09-19: anonymous api.github.com GET → 200).
# Advanced Charts is proprietary and distributed through a private repo
# TradingView grants access to; committing its files here would redistribute
# them publicly and break the licence. Fetch it into place instead — see
# docs/CHART_ANALYSIS_PLAN.md §1.2.
/public/charting_library

# NOTE: Caddyfile used to be ignored here as "local dev tooling for tunnel
# exposure". It is tracked from 2026-09-19: it is now the reference copy of the
# config that serves the LIVE operator console (static release files, plus
# /api/* and /health* proxying to the engine), not a throwaway. Ignoring it
# meant the only copy of that routing lived in /opt/homebrew/etc on one machine,
# with no history and no way to see what a bad edit changed. It holds no secrets.
